  "full_bio": "Hello! I am Siamul Karim Khan. I am currently a Software Engineer at Google, working in the Ads Integrity team. I completed my PhD in Computer Science and Engineering (CSE) at the University of Notre Dame, where I worked as a member of the Notre Dame Computer Vision Research Laboratory under the mentorship of Prof. Adam Czajka. My research focuses on designing and applying deep learning models to improve iris biometrics. I interned at Meta during the summers of 2024 and 2025. I have completed my B.Sc. in CSE from Bangladesh University of Engineering and Technology (BUET). You can browse this website to learn more about me.",
